The suite compares models and agent setups on coding and software-building tasks. It also tests models directly. Each run starts in a fresh temporary workspace, records the model’s traffic, checks the files or browser result, and saves the outcome for later review.

The repository is private. This page shows how the suite works and three defects its checks exposed.
